id: pm-wejmmy
title: Refresh compatible Sentry 10.76.2 observability patch
description: Adopt the newest seven-day-eligible Sentry 10 patch from the currently supported line. Official 10.76.2 release includes internal exception attachment exclusion and token-usage normalization. Preserve consent and privacy filtering plus existing SDK error classification and native packaged transport behavior. Keep the independent Sentry 11 migration with its existing owner pm-t3jxjj.
